# UI/UX Design System & Aesthetics Rules

- Never produce generic, plain, or unstyled UI.
- Use curated HSL color schemes with deep dark surfaces (`hsl(224, 71%, 4%)`) and subtle translucent borders (`hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 0.08)`).
- Apply backdrop blur (`backdrop-filter: blur(16px)`) for cards, dialogs, and headers.
- Choose modern typography: Inter, Plus Jakarta Sans, or Outfit with tight heading tracking.
- Incorporate subtle micro-animations (hover lift, active scale-down, smooth cubic-bezier transitions).
- Provide visual feedback for all interactive states (hover, active, focus, disabled).
